OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdescriptions of sexual violence which
OL,8,Fsome readers may find upsetting
OL,10,FWomen who served in the British
OL,11,Fmilitary have told ITV News they
OL,12,Fendured a toxic culture where sexual
OL,13,Fabuse was an everyday threat and
OL,14,Fcomplaints were routinely ignored.
OL,16,FTwo women, who have recently left the
OL,17,Farmed forces, told us they have 'lost
OL,18,Fcount' of the number of times they
OL,19,Fwere sexually assaulted during their
OL,20,Ftime serving.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
