FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FOne of them, who served in the Army
OL,7,Ffor decades, told us the abuse was at
OL,8,Fits worst in the senior ranks.
OL,10,FNearly two thirds of servicewomen have
OL,11,Fexperienced sexualised behaviour in
OL,12,Fthe space of a year according to the
OL,13,Flatest Ministry of Defence (MOD)
OL,14,Ffigures released in 2025.
OL,16,FThose behaviours include leering and
OL,17,Finappropriate jokes to the most
OL,18,Fserious sexual offences like groping,
OL,19,Fharassment and rape.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
