FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FThe MOD says it is determined to root
OL,7,Fout criminality, bullying and
OL,8,Fmisogyny, with almost 300 service
OL,9,Fpersonnel having been kicked out of
OL,10,Fthe organisation over the last three
OL,11,Fyears for 'unacceptable behaviours'.
OL,13,FWatch Her Fight: Are Women in the
OL,14,FArmed Forces Safe? on ITVX
OL,16,FOne former soldier, who we are calling
OL,17,FAbby, was raped multiple times during
OL,18,Fher short career in the Army. We are
OL,19,Fprotecting her identity because her
OL,20,Ffamily does not know about the abuse
OL,21,Fshe has suffered.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FFrom a young age Abby wanted to become
OL,7,Fa soldier but not long after signing
OL,8,Fup, she was subjected to violence and
OL,9,Fsexual abuse.
OL,11,F"The incidents started happening when
OL,12,FI came out of phase one basic
OL,13,Ftraining", she said.
OL,15,F"I've been raped by 12 different
OL,16,Fpeople multiple times and sexually
OL,17,Fassaulted..I've lost count, honestly."
OL,19,FAs Abby's career continued, she said
OL,20,Fthe abuse did too.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"I was called a slag in a hall around
OL,7,Fthe camps, even easy. Then it happened
OL,8,Feven more because everyone just
OL,9,Fthought I was easy to grab onto and
OL,10,Fuse. I just got used more and more."
OL,12,FIf you are affected by any issues
OL,13,Fraised in this article, there is help
OL,14,Favailable on our advice and support
OL,15,Fpage.
OL,17,FAbby reported what had happened to
OL,18,Fsenior colleagues but she says she was
OL,19,Fignored and even punished.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
