PN,40106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FShe says she was so violently raped on
OL,7,Fone occasion that she suffered serious
OL,8,Fphysical injuries to her head.
OL,10,F"No matter how much you spoke up about
OL,11,Fit, no one seemed to care", she said.
OL,13,FAfter she complained, she says senior
OL,14,Fofficers "refused" to mend the lock on
OL,15,Fher bedroom door, despite her asking,
OL,16,Fmaking her feel unsafe and vulnerable.
OL,18,F"Men would just come in your room and
OL,19,Ftake advantage of you or they'll drag
OL,20,Fyou in places people don't really go
OL,21,Fin (and) rape you", she said.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
