FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FOne of Abby's attackers was convicted
OL,7,Fof sexual assault and discharged from
OL,8,Fthe military, however many of her
OL,9,Fallegations did not reach a military
OL,10,For criminal court. She eventually gave
OL,11,Fup even reporting incidents.
OL,13,FIf you've been affected by the issues
OL,14,Fraised in this article and would be
OL,15,Fhappy to talk to a journalist, please
OL,16,Femail militarystories@itv.com.
OL,18,F"I couldn't even go to work. I
OL,19,Fcouldn't even exit my house and see
OL,20,Fmen anymore because the uniforms would
OL,21,Ftrigger me", she said.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
