PN,40108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FAbby was discharged from the Army
OL,7,Fafter being diagnosed with complex
OL,8,FPTSD following the trauma she
OL,9,Fexperienced.
OL,11,F"I can never tell my family what
OL,12,Fhappened to me and I never will. I'll
OL,13,Falways be hiding something", she said.
OL,15,F"I can never trust men really ever
OL,16,Fagain."
OL,18,F'The abuse was worst in the higher
OL,19,Franks'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
