PN,40109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FAnother former soldier, who we're
OL,7,Fcalling Sophia, served in the Army for
OL,8,Fdecades.
OL,10,FShe says she was trapped in a toxic
OL,11,Fculture where bullying and sexual
OL,12,Fassault were accepted behaviours.
OL,14,FAs a teenager, Sophia says she and
OL,15,Fsome other new recruits were locked in
OL,16,Fa room by an instructor.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"We were told that we can't leave
OL,7,Funtil one of us had performed a sexual
OL,8,Fact on him, which one of the girls
OL,9,Fdid, just so that we could leave", she
OL,10,Ftold ITV News. "This is a well known
OL,11,Fperson in the forces as well", she
OL,12,Fadded.
OL,14,FSophia says she was part of a "boys'
OL,15,Fclub", which meant she and her female
OL,16,Fcolleagues "didn't have a voice".
OL,18,F"I have lost count of the amount of
OL,19,Ftimes I have been groped on my chest
OL,20,Fand between my legs.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"(But) if you talk to somebody about
OL,7,Fit, it's; 'That's just that person,
OL,8,Fthat's just the way they are. That's
OL,9,Ftheir character. They don't mean it.'
OL,11,F"And this didn't stop", she said.
OL,12,F"This was throughout my whole career.
OL,13,FIn fact, I would say it wasJprobably
OL,14,Fworse higher in the ranks."
OL,16,F"I've had somebody banging on my door
OL,17,Fwhen they were drunk", she said. "I
OL,18,Fopened the door and he forced himself
OL,19,Fon me, but I managed to get him out of
OL,20,Fmy room.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"I soon learned that opening your door
OL,7,Fis not the right thing. So one day I
OL,8,Fdidn't open my door and somebody was
OL,9,Fbanging on it quite aggressively. I
OL,10,Flay in my bed and all he did was
OL,11,Fshout, 'Why don't you just effing put
OL,12,Fout?'
OL,14,F"Nobody comes out of their room to
OL,15,Fstop them. Nobody does anything."
OL,17,F'In every part of my life I feel I am
OL,18,Fnot being listened to'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40113
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FSophia was medically discharged from
OL,7,Fthe Army because she was suffering
OL,8,Fwith mental health issues which she
OL,9,Fsays were a result of what she had
OL,10,Fexperienced.
OL,12,F"I feel failed. I feel that I was
OL,13,Fsomebody I wasn't. I look back now and
OL,14,FI'm actually embarrassed by the person
OL,15,FI was just to fit in, you know, you
OL,16,Fsay things you don't want to say, you
OL,17,Fdo things you don't want to do just to
OL,18,Ffit in in that culture.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40114
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"I went through a stage where I wanted
OL,7,Fto end my life because I didn't feel
OL,8,Flistened to; and all I feel now is
OL,9,Fthat wherever I go, I feel I'm not
OL,10,Fgoing to be listened to.
OL,12,F"In all of my relationships with
OL,13,Fpeople, my family, everything, I just
OL,14,Ffeel like people aren't listening, and
OL,15,Fit's really traumatising. I have this
OL,16,Fawful guilt that if I'd have spoken up
OL,17,Fwhen I was a younger soldier that some
OL,18,Fof the girls now would have had better
OL,19,Ftreatment."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
