OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FWhen life is difficult, Samaritans are
OL,7,Fhere ` day or night, 365 days a year.
OL,8,FYou can call them for free on 116 123,
OL,9,Femail them at jo@samaritans.org, or
OL,10,Fvisit www.samaritans.org to find your
OL,11,Fnearest branch.
OL,13,FThe culture of the Army has been under
OL,14,Fthe spotlight since the death of 19-
OL,15,Fyear-old soldier Jaysley Beck.
OL,17,FJaysley took her own life at her
OL,18,Fbarracks at Larkhill camp in Wiltshire
OL,19,Fin December 2021, just months after
OL,20,Fshe was sexually assaulted by a senior
OL,21,Fcolleague.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G15/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40116
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FShe had reported the assault to her
OL,7,Fsuperiors the morning after it
OL,8,Fhappened, but it was not then reported
OL,9,Fto the service police.
OL,11,FThe Army has since admitted it did not
OL,12,Flisten to Jaysley when she reported
OL,13,Fthe assault and has apologised for its
OL,14,Fhandling of her complaint.
OL,16,FFollowing an inquest into her death,
OL,17,FMichael Webber pleaded guilty to one
OL,18,Fcount of sexual assault and was jailed
OL,19,Ffor six months.
OL,21,F'The Army's culture is coded masculine'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G16/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40117
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FTony King from the University of
OL,7,FExeter was commissioned by the Army in
OL,8,F2022 to investigate its culture.
OL,10,F"One of the things to note is the
OL,11,Fstrangeness of the Army as an
OL,12,Forganisation. It is very male,
OL,13,Fextremely young and many of those men
OL,14,Fare drawn from tough backgrounds and
OL,15,Fyou're involved in the prosecution of
OL,16,Fwarfare where levels of aggression and
OL,17,Fviolence and intimidation are actually
OL,18,Ftotally required.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G17/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40118
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FHe continued: "Because 90% of the Army
OL,7,Fis male - the entire culture is coded
OL,8,Fmasculine. This makes inclusion
OL,9,Fdifficult and issues of harassment and
OL,10,Fbullying much more likely."
OL,12,FProfessor King interviewed hundreds of
OL,13,Fsoldiers, both male and female, and
OL,14,Funcovered significant issues of
OL,15,F'integration' as well as cases of
OL,16,Fharassment and sexual assault.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G18/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40119
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FProfessor King made several
OL,7,Frecommendations following his
OL,8,Fresearch, which the Ministry of
OL,9,FDefence says it has accepted and used
OL,10,Fto inform policy changes.
OL,12,F"Key actions include the Service
OL,13,FJustice System being more victim-
OL,14,Ffocused with the establishment of the
OL,15,FDefence Serious Crime Command in April
OL,16,F2022 and the Victim and Witness Care
OL,17,FUnit", a spokesperson said.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G19/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40120
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FThey added that in 2022, the Zero
OL,7,FTolerance to Unacceptable Sexual
OL,8,FBehaviours policy was introduced,
OL,9,Fwhich has resulted in hundreds of
OL,10,Fservice personnel being kicked out of
OL,11,Fthe armed forces.
OL,13,F'I thought he was a safe person to
OL,14,Freport things to and then he ended up
OL,15,Fgroping me'
OL,17,FAnother woman, who we are calling
OL,18,FKate, worked in another part of the
OL,19,Fmilitary. We are not revealing which
OL,20,Fbranch she served in because we are
OL,21,Fprotecting her identity.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G20/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
