OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40121
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"There was a culture of like...let's
OL,7,Fsee if we can break her", she told ITV
OL,8,FNews.
OL,10,F"I almost feel like it was a free for
OL,11,Fall for like who could sleep with you
OL,12,Ffirst. Like it was like a competition.
OL,13,FThen I reported that to a more senior
OL,14,Fofficer and then that senior officer
OL,15,Fsort of took me under his wing.
OL,17,F"I felt like he was a safe person to
OL,18,Freport things to and then he ended up
OL,19,Fgroping me."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G21/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40122
SC,0022
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"I didn't feel safe walking around the
OL,7,Funit after tea time. I felt like I was
OL,8,Fwalking around with a target
OL,9,Fsometimes", she added.
OL,11,FAfter months of feeling ignored when
OL,12,Fshe tried to highlight behaviour to
OL,13,Fsenior officers, Kate says she was
OL,14,Fraped.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G22/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40123
SC,0023
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FArmed with texts messages from the
OL,7,Fperpetrator saying he was sorry, Kate
OL,8,Fsaid she thought the investigative and
OL,9,Fjudicial process would be
OL,10,Fstraightforward, but in reality, she
OL,11,Fsays it was long, complicated and
OL,12,Ftraumatic.
OL,14,FBoth the groping incident and rape
OL,15,Fallegation were heard at a court
OL,16,Fmartial which is the military's own
OL,17,Fjustice system.
OL,19,FRead more: How does a military justice
OL,20,Fsystem work and is it fit for purpose?
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G23/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40124
SC,0024
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FOne defendant was found guilty of
OL,7,Fgroping and was discharged from
OL,8,Fservice but the other defendant, who
OL,9,Fwas accused of rape, was found not
OL,10,Fguilty.
OL,12,FKate described the court process as
OL,13,F'traumatic'.
OL,15,F"I just feel like he wasn't really
OL,16,Frobbed of his career in the same way
OL,17,Fthat I was", Kate said.
OL,19,F"I (also) feel like had it been
OL,20,Finvestigated efficiently and timely,
OL,21,Fthat wouldn't have been the outcome."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G24/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40125
SC,0025
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FKate returned to work after both court
OL,7,Fcases but eventually her mental health
OL,8,Fdeteriorated so much that she was
OL,9,Fmedically discharged from service
OL,10,Fbecause of PTSD.
OL,12,F'The rapes that are coming through are
OL,13,Fbrutal', says support charity
OL,15,FKate, Sophia and Abby are all
OL,16,Fsupported by a charity called Salute
OL,17,FHer, which offers specialist support
OL,18,Ffor serving women and veterans.
OL,20,FThe oldest women the charity supports
OL,21,Fis aged 88 and the youngest is 18.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G25/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40126
SC,0026
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FSalute Her is currently experiencing a
OL,7,Frapid growth in demand. On average,
OL,8,Fone new woman contacts them every day
OL,9,Ffor support.
OL,11,FThe charity says that the types of
OL,12,Fsexual assaults being committed
OL,13,Fagainst women are becoming more
OL,14,Fviolent.
OL,16,F"The rapes that are coming through
OL,17,Frecently are really brutal", said
OL,18,FNicole Dodds, Deputy Chief Executive
OL,19,Fat the charity.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G26/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40127
SC,0027
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"What I mean by brutal is gang rapes,
OL,7,Fmultiple rapes, women being filmed
OL,8,Fhaving consensual sex but then it
OL,9,Fbeing uploaded to Pornhub for
OL,10,Feverybody to watch", she said.
OL,12,FPaula Edwards, the charity's Chief
OL,13,FExecutive, says the charity sees an
OL,14,Feven spread of women from all the
OL,15,Fdifferent services in need of their
OL,16,Fhelp.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G27/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40128
SC,0028
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"People think it is, but it isn't just
OL,7,Fan army problem. We see Navy women, we
OL,8,Fsee women from the RAF, and the
OL,9,Fproblem is just as prolific in those
OL,10,Fservices as it is in the Army."
OL,12,FShe continued: "I think that people
OL,13,Fthink that people who join the RAF are
OL,14,Fbetter educated and should know better.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G28/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40129
SC,0029
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"People think that those in the Navy
OL,7,Fare the same, that they're educated
OL,8,Fbetter, that, you know, there's more
OL,9,Ftests that they have to pass to get
OL,10,Fin, they have to have more
OL,11,Fqualifications or life experience. But
OL,12,Fthat attitude is not correct."
OL,14,FThe charity says the support it offers
OL,15,Fwomen is often focussed on helping
OL,16,Fwomen to heal from sexual abuse.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G29/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40130
SC,0030
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"We run the only military sexual
OL,7,Ftrauma group in the country. Women
OL,8,Fwere coming to us and they were
OL,9,Ftelling us that they wanted to be
OL,10,Fintimate again. They couldn't, they
OL,11,Fhated themselves, they felt disgusted
OL,12,Fwith their bodies, and they were
OL,13,Freally, really struggling.
OL,15,F"So we developed a unique course where
OL,16,Fwe taught women how to love their
OL,17,Fbodies again, how to be intimate
OL,18,Fagain, how to have boundaries, how to
OL,19,Fgive consent`all of the things that
OL,20,Fthey didn't know before."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G30/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40131
SC,0031
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F'Brutal and horrendous experiences'
OL,8,FITV News put all of the women's
OL,9,Fexperiences to Sam des Forges, the
OL,10,FDirector of Conduct, Equity and
OL,11,FJustice at the MOD.
OL,13,FShe said the military is determined to
OL,14,Froot out all criminality and
OL,15,Funacceptable behaviour, regardless of
OL,16,Frank.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G31/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40132
SC,0032
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FShe said almost 300 service personnel
OL,7,Fhave been kicked out of the
OL,8,Forganisation over the last four years
OL,9,Fas part of the zero-tolerance policy
OL,10,Faiming to tackling unacceptable
OL,11,Fbehaviour. Those incidents involve
OL,12,Fbehaviours that do not reach a
OL,13,Fcriminal threshold.
OL,15,F"I commend those women for raising
OL,16,Fthose horrendous and brutal
OL,17,Fexperiences that you describe", she
OL,18,Ftold ITV News.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G32/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40133
SC,0033
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"There's a lot of focus at the moment
OL,7,Fon the broader societal challenges and
OL,8,Fthat's why Defence is really stepping
OL,9,Finto the work that Government is doing
OL,10,Fto halve violence against women and
OL,11,Fgirls...But I think we're also not
OL,12,Fnaive that there's one silver bullet
OL,13,Fthat is going to solve this."
OL,15,FShe argued that the Ministry of
OL,16,FDefence's latest 2025 sexual behaviour
OL,17,Fsurvey is proof that the organisation
OL,18,Fis taking issues of harassment and
OL,19,Fabuse seriously.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G33/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40134
SC,0034
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FThe survey results showed that 67% of
OL,7,Fwomen serving in the military reported
OL,8,Fexperiencing sexualised behaviour in
OL,9,Fthe space of a year. One in ten also
OL,10,Freported experiencing non-consensual
OL,11,Fsexual activity.
OL,13,F"I think there are very few
OL,14,Forganisations that undertake that sort
OL,15,Fof research and then put it out
OL,16,Fpublicly for public scrutiny", she
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,F'Rank is not a protective cover'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G34/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40135
SC,0035
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"Whether it's behaviours from a number
OL,7,Fof years ago or whether it's recent
OL,8,Fbehaviours, regardless of rank,
OL,9,FDefence has taken really strong
OL,10,Faction. I think that's a really
OL,11,Fimportant message, that rank is not a
OL,12,Fprotective cover."
OL,14,FSam des Forges says the organisation
OL,15,Fis working hard to ensure there are
OL,16,Fappropriate, independent routes for
OL,17,Fanyone wanting to report a crime in
OL,18,Fthe military.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G35/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40136
SC,0036
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FIn 2022, the Defence Serious Crime
OL,7,FCommand was set up as a unit where
OL,8,Fvictims can have their case
OL,9,Finvestigated independently of their
OL,10,Fchain of command.
OL,12,F"I would really encourage women to
OL,13,Freach out when they have been subject
OL,14,Fto those sorts of criminal behaviours,
OL,15,Fto reach out to the police.
OL,17,F"That could be the civilian police,
OL,18,Fthat could be the service police,
OL,19,Fequally the Victim and Witness Care
OL,20,FUnit...we're putting half a million
OL,21,Fpounds in to expand that."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G36/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40137
SC,0037
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FShe added that the military court
OL,7,Fsystem is providing fair and rigorous
OL,8,Fjustice for service personnel.
OL,10,F"We don't have a backlog, so they're
OL,11,Fgoing through (the service justice
OL,12,Fsystem) at greater pace. I think a
OL,13,Ftestament to the support we provide is
OL,14,Fwe have virtually no folk who are
OL,15,Fwithdrawing from cases once they reach
OL,16,Fcourt or even during the
OL,17,Finvestigation."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G37/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40138
SC,0038
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,FWhen asked what the military is doing
OL,7,Fto support service women who have
OL,8,Fsuffered abuse, Sam des Forges said
OL,9,Fthe MOD's message is to "reach out for
OL,10,Fhelp".
OL,12,F"On a really simple level, we have
OL,13,Fsomething called the Call It Out Hub,
OL,14,Fwhich just provides lots of insight
OL,15,Fand access to how you can obtain that
OL,16,Fsupport.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G38/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40139
SC,0039
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787080721
OL,3,CInside the 'brutal' culture of sexual
OL,4,Cabuse and violence in British military
OL,6,F"But.. we are not going to ever say
OL,7,Fwe've got this solved. I don't think
OL,8,Fsociety can say it's got this solved
OL,9,Fyet. We want to learn, we want to
OL,10,Fimprove, we want to take that on board.
OL,12,F"We don't want folk in our
OL,13,Forganisation who are perpetrating
OL,14,Fthese sorts of behaviours", she added.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G39/39
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
